The purpose of this code of ethics is to:
(1) Encourage high ethical standards in official conduct by city officials;
(2) Establish guidelines for ethical standards of conduct for all such officials by setting forth those acts or actions that are incompatible with the interests of the city;
(3) Require disclosure by such officials of private financial or other interests in matters affecting the city; and
(4) Serve as a basis for disciplining those who refuse to abide by the code's terms.
(Ord. No. 05-2026, § 1, 4-6-2026)
